; GridHedge preset — the "+£24k OHLC" uncapped config, for DEMO observation.
; This is the TRUE JNS behavior: book greens, let losers float freely, no caps.
; PURPOSE: watch it on live demo fills. Expectation from real-tick test:
;   it tracks toward a large drawdown / wipeout, NOT +£24k. The +£24k was an
;   OHLC-model artifact that does not survive real fills.
; Load via: attach GridHedge to XAUUSD M5 -> Inputs tab -> Load -> this file.
